{
  "schema_version": "text-light-input-1.0",
  "unit_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_u01",
  "video_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2",
  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你相信吗，越没用的东西越值钱，人一定会为漂亮的东西买单，就算不买也会念念不忘，花钱买情绪价值这个事儿，谁都跑不了。#情绪价值 #悦己经济 #拉布布 #治愈",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 218.267007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "Jj,你相信吗？越没用的东西越值钱。比如像这种拉波波的玩偶，一个要大几百上千，它有什么用呢？它能给孩子辅导作业吗？他没有任何用，但是如果把它里面做成一个，比如蓝牙音箱很有用，它反而就不值钱了。如果它里面有个u盘，但是最多只会买一个。因为你会从功能性的考虑，已经有一个了，没必要再多买一个u盘。正是因为拉波布除了情绪价值之外，一无所用，大家才会一买再买，你相信吗？人一定会为漂亮的东西买单，就算不买，也会念念不忘。比如最近的苹果折叠屏，实在找不到其他任何优点。你看开屏的渐变动画就成了最大的卖点，而且这种情绪价值的审美是高度个性化的。比如我个人就觉得拉波波长得很，像个飞，整天呲个牙，还有点阴森邪恶的笑。他并不在我的审之之上。我虽然不买他的东西，但是完全不单我的老婆，孩子会买。之所以我没有入坑，是因为他开发的IP还没有在我的心坎上。但是花钱买情趣驾驶这个事儿谁都跑不了。那这是一代人有一代人的茅台，比如你觉得茅台的竞争对手会是其他酒吗？喝茅台的人是不用买茅台的，买茅台的人是舍不得自己喝的这叫社交领域的情绪价值。泡泡玛特的老板有个理论，我最近发现特别深刻。他说，假如你是一个千万富翁，你出门的时候忘记关掉厨房水龙头了，你会觉得不舒服，总觉得浪费了几十块钱。但是你家小区门口的高级景观喷泉，哪怕不是循环的水，每天浪费那么多水，你完全不会心疼。因此，情绪价值有时候比钱更重要，就像几乎没有人是因为要看时间才去买那么贵的手表，它最没用的地方恰恰是它最值钱的部分。你发现了吗？只要没有具体功能，就不会存在够用了。这三字情感永远不会饱和，于是你会买第二个。第三个，这就是无用及永恒。人永远比自己以为的要感性的多。而且你回头想想，真正撑起你人生厚度的，恰恰全是一些无用之事。每天傍晚下楼散的那一圈步，阳台上那会儿养了半年才开一朵的花。他们不赚钱，不加分、不升值，不产生任何显性效益。可他们在悄悄治愈你的焦虑，抚平你的疲惫有用的事，养活你的生活，无用的事，养活你的灵魂。而最魔幻的是，越拼命追求有用的人，眼里越没有光。反倒是那些肯花时间没用的人，活的热气腾腾。魏晋时期，门阀斗的你死我活，读书人连小命都未必保得住。竹林七贤跑到山里喝酒，弹琴长啸，不谈仕途、只谈风月。在那样一个玩不好就要掉脑袋的年代里，无用，反倒成了他们保命的方式。在过去那个物质稀缺的时代，我们主打一个功能价值。而现在是物质过剩的时代，在功能上面要叠加情绪价值。这就是月季经济。许多人都在抱怨说内卷严重，大家没有消费能力了。来，你看一下拉布布，全世界都在排队买。不光是中国，其实并不是消费者没有消费能力的，而是旧的商业思维，无法适应新的市场。如今在九子灵活时期，你要靠近所有跟情绪、跟能量、跟文化相关的场域。当消费者愿意为情绪价值去支付溢价，什么叫溢价？你明明知道这玩意生产出来可能只需要几十块钱，但是也仍然愿意花几百和几千去买它。传统的成本定价逻辑已经失效了，情绪价值一定是未来十年最大的风口。从今天起，允许自己读一本不能立马变现的书，走一条不通往任何目的的路。在阳台上发十分钟没用的呆，因为那些没用的时刻，才是你真正活着的时刻。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 630,
      "end_ms": 1030,
      "text": "Jj,"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1330,
      "end_ms": 2150,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2390,
      "end_ms": 4610,
      "text": "越没用的东西越值钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5070,
      "end_ms": 6730,
      "text": "比如像这种拉波波的玩偶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6730,
      "end_ms": 8130,
      "text": "一个要大几百上千，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8430,
      "end_ms": 9330,
      "text": "它有什么用呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9530,
      "end_ms": 11010,
      "text": "它能给孩子辅导作业吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11150,
      "end_ms": 12190,
      "text": "他没有任何用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12430,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "但是如果把它里面做成一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14770,
      "end_ms": 16270,
      "text": "比如蓝牙音箱很有用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16509,
      "end_ms": 17810,
      "text": "它反而就不值钱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 18190,
      "end_ms": 19490,
      "text": "如果它里面有个u盘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 19790,
      "end_ms": 21250,
      "text": "但是最多只会买一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21410,
      "end_ms": 22990,
      "text": "因为你会从功能性的考虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22990,
      "end_ms": 23770,
      "text": "已经有一个了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23770,
      "end_ms": 25190,
      "text": "没必要再多买一个u盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25410,
      "end_ms": 27730,
      "text": "正是因为拉波布除了情绪价值之外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 27730,
      "end_ms": 28530,
      "text": "一无所用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 28530,
      "end_ms": 30135,
      "text": "大家才会一买再买，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 30500,
      "end_ms": 31160,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 31260,
      "end_ms": 33420,
      "text": "人一定会为漂亮的东西买单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 33600,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "就算不买，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 34520,
      "end_ms": 35520,
      "text": "也会念念不忘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 35760,
      "end_ms": 37180,
      "text": "比如最近的苹果折叠屏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 37380,
      "end_ms": 39120,
      "text": "实在找不到其他任何优点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 39120,
      "end_ms": 42220,
      "text": "你看开屏的渐变动画就成了最大的卖点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 42340,
      "end_ms": 45380,
      "text": "而且这种情绪价值的审美是高度个性化的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 45380,
      "end_ms": 47380,
      "text": "比如我个人就觉得拉波波长得很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 47380,
      "end_ms": 47980,
      "text": "像个飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 48180,
      "end_ms": 49000,
      "text": "整天呲个牙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 49000,
      "end_ms": 50440,
      "text": "还有点阴森邪恶的笑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 50580,
      "end_ms": 52100,
      "text": "他并不在我的审之之上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 52340,
      "end_ms": 53660,
      "text": "我虽然不买他的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 53840,
      "end_ms": 55300,
      "text": "但是完全不单我的老婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 55300,
      "end_ms": 55980,
      "text": "孩子会买。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 57360,
      "text": "之所以我没有入坑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 57480,
      "end_ms": 59905,
      "text": "是因为他开发的IP还没有在我的心坎上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 60210,
      "end_ms": 63315,
      "text": "但是花钱买情趣驾驶这个事儿谁都跑不了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 63670,
      "end_ms": 65790,
      "text": "那这是一代人有一代人的茅台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 66050,
      "end_ms": 69045,
      "text": "比如你觉得茅台的竞争对手会是其他酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 69420,
      "end_ms": 71400,
      "text": "喝茅台的人是不用买茅台的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 71500,
      "end_ms": 75525,
      "text": "买茅台的人是舍不得自己喝的这叫社交领域的情绪价值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 75790,
      "end_ms": 77190,
      "text": "泡泡玛特的老板有个理论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 77190,
      "end_ms": 78550,
      "text": "我最近发现特别深刻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 78550,
      "end_ms": 78995,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79350,
      "end_ms": 80825,
      "text": "假如你是一个千万富翁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 81040,
      "end_ms": 83445,
      "text": "你出门的时候忘记关掉厨房水龙头了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 83660,
      "end_ms": 84600,
      "text": "你会觉得不舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 84600,
      "end_ms": 86005,
      "text": "总觉得浪费了几十块钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 86390,
      "end_ms": 88670,
      "text": "但是你家小区门口的高级景观喷泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 88670,
      "end_ms": 89990,
      "text": "哪怕不是循环的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90090,
      "end_ms": 91350,
      "text": "每天浪费那么多水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 91430,
      "end_ms": 92610,
      "text": "你完全不会心疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 92830,
      "end_ms": 93270,
      "text": "因此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 93330,
      "end_ms": 95585,
      "text": "情绪价值有时候比钱更重要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 95860,
      "end_ms": 99315,
      "text": "就像几乎没有人是因为要看时间才去买那么贵的手表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 99700,
      "end_ms": 102600,
      "text": "它最没用的地方恰恰是它最值钱的部分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 102660,
      "end_ms": 103365,
      "text": "你发现了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 103620,
      "end_ms": 104820,
      "text": "只要没有具体功能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 104820,
      "end_ms": 106220,
      "text": "就不会存在够用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 106220,
      "end_ms": 108690,
      "text": "这三字情感永远不会饱和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 108710,
      "end_ms": 110310,
      "text": "于是你会买第二个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 110310,
      "end_ms": 110890,
      "text": "第三个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 110910,
      "end_ms": 112610,
      "text": "这就是无用及永恒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 112890,
      "end_ms": 115495,
      "text": "人永远比自己以为的要感性的多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 115930,
      "end_ms": 116950,
      "text": "而且你回头想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 116970,
      "end_ms": 118670,
      "text": "真正撑起你人生厚度的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 118750,
      "end_ms": 120815,
      "text": "恰恰全是一些无用之事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 121280,
      "end_ms": 123145,
      "text": "每天傍晚下楼散的那一圈步，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 123460,
      "end_ms": 125860,
      "text": "阳台上那会儿养了半年才开一朵的花。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 126120,
      "end_ms": 126920,
      "text": "他们不赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 126920,
      "end_ms": 128000,
      "text": "不加分、不升值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 128020,
      "end_ms": 129775,
      "text": "不产生任何显性效益。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 130080,
      "end_ms": 132000,
      "text": "可他们在悄悄治愈你的焦虑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 132000,
      "end_ms": 134230,
      "text": "抚平你的疲惫有用的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 134270,
      "end_ms": 135310,
      "text": "养活你的生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 135410,
      "end_ms": 136150,
      "text": "无用的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 136250,
      "end_ms": 137330,
      "text": "养活你的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 137570,
      "end_ms": 138530,
      "text": "而最魔幻的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 138650,
      "end_ms": 140250,
      "text": "越拼命追求有用的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 140270,
      "end_ms": 141329,
      "text": "眼里越没有光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 141530,
      "end_ms": 143950,
      "text": "反倒是那些肯花时间没用的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 143990,
      "end_ms": 145205,
      "text": "活的热气腾腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 145550,
      "end_ms": 146230,
      "text": "魏晋时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 146270,
      "end_ms": 147710,
      "text": "门阀斗的你死我活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 147730,
      "end_ms": 149675,
      "text": "读书人连小命都未必保得住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 150000,
      "end_ms": 151840,
      "text": "竹林七贤跑到山里喝酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 151940,
      "end_ms": 152955,
      "text": "弹琴长啸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 153270,
      "end_ms": 154945,
      "text": "不谈仕途、只谈风月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 155280,
      "end_ms": 157660,
      "text": "在那样一个玩不好就要掉脑袋的年代里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 157660,
      "end_ms": 158060,
      "text": "无用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 158240,
      "end_ms": 159840,
      "text": "反倒成了他们保命的方式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 160100,
      "end_ms": 162160,
      "text": "在过去那个物质稀缺的时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 162160,
      "end_ms": 163715,
      "text": "我们主打一个功能价值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 164000,
      "end_ms": 165820,
      "text": "而现在是物质过剩的时代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 165900,
      "end_ms": 168145,
      "text": "在功能上面要叠加情绪价值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 168380,
      "end_ms": 169965,
      "text": "这就是月季经济。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 170240,
      "end_ms": 172200,
      "text": "许多人都在抱怨说内卷严重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 172240,
      "end_ms": 173620,
      "text": "大家没有消费能力了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 173620,
      "end_ms": 173860,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 173980,
      "end_ms": 174920,
      "text": "你看一下拉布布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 175080,
      "end_ms": 176480,
      "text": "全世界都在排队买。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 176480,
      "end_ms": 177355,
      "text": "不光是中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 177740,
      "end_ms": 179860,
      "text": "其实并不是消费者没有消费能力的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 179880,
      "end_ms": 181400,
      "text": "而是旧的商业思维，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 181440,
      "end_ms": 182900,
      "text": "无法适应新的市场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 183120,
      "end_ms": 185100,
      "text": "如今在九子灵活时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 185280,
      "end_ms": 189635,
      "text": "你要靠近所有跟情绪、跟能量、跟文化相关的场域。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 189890,
      "end_ms": 192650,
      "text": "当消费者愿意为情绪价值去支付溢价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 192730,
      "end_ms": 193525,
      "text": "什么叫溢价？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 193770,
      "end_ms": 196625,
      "text": "你明明知道这玩意生产出来可能只需要几十块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 196900,
      "end_ms": 199435,
      "text": "但是也仍然愿意花几百和几千去买它。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 199800,
      "end_ms": 202575,
      "text": "传统的成本定价逻辑已经失效了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 203000,
      "end_ms": 205705,
      "text": "情绪价值一定是未来十年最大的风口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 206040,
      "end_ms": 206740,
      "text": "从今天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 206900,
      "end_ms": 209320,
      "text": "允许自己读一本不能立马变现的书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 209500,
      "end_ms": 211580,
      "text": "走一条不通往任何目的的路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 211720,
      "end_ms": 214355,
      "text": "在阳台上发十分钟没用的呆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 214710,
      "end_ms": 216110,
      "text": "因为那些没用的时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9eb25043ec7535d2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 216250,
      "end_ms": 218015,
      "text": "才是你真正活着的时刻。"
    }
  ],
